+    """Construct the system prompt split into two parts.
+
+    * The static coaching *INSTRUCTIONS* are supplied as a plain system block.
+      This block has no ``cache_control`` flag, allowing the underlying model
+      cache to retain it across calls.
+    * The per‑athlete context (date, zones, facts, etc.) is supplied as a
+      second system block with ``cache_control: {type: "ephemeral"}``.  This
+      tells the model that the block may change between requests (e.g. when a
+      new fact is saved) without discarding the cached static instructions.
+
+    Returning two separate blocks preserves the static instruction cache while
+    still updating the dynamic athlete information.
+    """
+    static_block = {"type": "text", "text": INSTRUCTIONS}
+    dynamic_block = {
+        "type": "text",
+        "text": athlete_context(a, today),
+        "cache_control": {"type": "ephemeral"},
+    }
+    return [static_block, dynamic_block]
 
